{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured and verified the three-node OpenTelemetry routing topology. Node1 accepts OTLP/HTTP HTTPS with client-certificate authentication, routes payments exclusively to node2 and inventory exclusively to node3, and returns HTTP 503 for missing or unsupported namespaces. All services and retained traces survived verified node restarts.","actions_performed":["Installed checksum-verified otelcol-contrib 0.162.0 on all nodes.","Generated a private CA and role-specific mTLS certificates on managed nodes.","Created client credentials under /root/otel-client on node1 with a mode-0600 private key.","Configured node2 and node3 with mTLS OTLP receivers and append-mode JSON file exporters.","Configured node1 with move-only namespace routing and synchronous rejection of unmatched traces.","Verified valid routing, rejection, client-certificate enforcement, no cross-routing, and exactly-once delivery of proof traces.","Restarted nodes individually, corrected the initially observed exporter truncation by enabling append mode, and repeated node2's restart verification successfully."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"HTTPS OTLP/HTTP gateway, valid routing, invalid namespace rejection, and client mTLS","command_ids":["cmd-70b5b11a8bd04bb3"],"summary":"After all restarts, payments and inventory returned HTTP 200, unsupported and missing namespaces returned HTTP 503, unauthenticated TLS returned certificate-required, and node1 remained healthy on port 4318."},{"requirement":"Mutual TLS between collectors","command_ids":["cmd-4fec6a9e3edc4003","cmd-9887ff6ee12f4f30"],"summary":"Node1's gateway certificate successfully verified node2 and node3, while both backend receivers rejected connections without a client certificate."},{"requirement":"Payments retained only on node2 without duplicate delivery","command_ids":["cmd-7aa1fe6755c84340"],"summary":"payments.json is healthy and contains each selected pre-restart, post-restart, and final payment proof exactly once; inventory, unsupported, and missing counts are zero."},{"requirement":"Inventory retained only on node3 without duplicate delivery","command_ids":["cmd-97f32e629e844972"],"summary":"inventory.json is healthy and contains each selected pre-restart, post-restart, and final inventory proof exactly once; payments, unsupported, and missing counts are zero."},{"requirement":"Client credentials provided on node1","command_ids":["cmd-23be569905bc42d6","cmd-70b5b11a8bd04bb3"],"summary":"The CA, client certificate, and client key exist under /root/otel-client; the key is mode 0600 and remained present after restart."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-23be569905bc42d6","cmd-5e79accd8dc54f44","cmd-1f03186d25004296","cmd-70b5b11a8bd04bb3"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot e8afb731... were captured, reboot acknowledged, boot changed to 736a8200..., and the gateway, credentials, routing, rejection, and listener recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-8a79ae18f18140b0","cmd-f3857b6dee744e16","cmd-52ec18bd63c74740","cmd-6d3e047f53f745fc","cmd-893b53be68424aa4"],"summary":"Corrected append-mode baseline and boot 16ece806... were captured, reboot acknowledged, boot changed to 48ffe152..., the pre-restart record survived, and a new record appended exactly once."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c29240b62c1e4e2b","cmd-c07cca80894b4d8c","cmd-2e327b0eff294198","cmd-efdd6750ecca4f01","cmd-25abea78377f4c3d"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot dfeb3b70... were captured, reboot acknowledged, boot changed to 8bc71908..., the existing inventory data survived, and a new record appended exactly once."}]}
